      "message": "eh. the source code you linked does honor empty askpass. \n\ngetenv returns a non-nil charptr to an empty string, \n\nthen the below `if (askpass \u0026\u0026 *askpass)` check only passes when askpass ptr is non-nil and askpass\u0027s first char is not NUL char (i.e. not an empty string).\n\nFYI, VSCode injects GIT_ASKPASS to its terminal, that\u0027s why I added it (it\u0027s a tiny prompt at the top of screen, which is easily overlooked).",
